{"4811000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forge and Flame", "steam_appid": 4811000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Forge weapons. Work together. Survive the battlefield.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge and Flame</strong> is a cooperative crafting and time-management game where 1–4 players take on the role of dwarven blacksmiths working on the front lines of a fantasy war. Gather resources, forge weapons, complete orders and deliver equipment before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to manage crafting stations, process materials, follow recipes and keep your forge running efficiently. Communication and teamwork are essential as you face increasing demands, unexpected disruptions and maintaining your neutrality to the best of your ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging orders, improve your workflow and master the art of forging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced crafting and time-management challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering and recipe-based weapon forging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple crafting stations and workshop management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic events and unexpected disruptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic cooperative gameplay designed for replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your fellow blacksmiths, light the forge and prove your craftsmanship on the battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Forge weapons. Work together. Survive the battlefield.</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge and Flame</strong> is a cooperative crafting and time-management game where 1–4 players take on the role of dwarven blacksmiths working on the front lines of a fantasy war. Gather resources, forge weapons, complete orders and deliver equipment before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to manage crafting stations, process materials, follow recipes and keep your forge running efficiently. Communication and teamwork are essential as you face increasing demands, unexpected disruptions and maintaining your neutrality to the best of your ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenging orders, improve your workflow and master the art of forging.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative gameplay for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced crafting and time-management challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering and recipe-based weapon forging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple crafting stations and workshop management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic events and unexpected disruptions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic cooperative gameplay designed for replayability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your fellow blacksmiths, light the forge and prove your craftsmanship on the battlefield.</p>", "short_description": "Light the forge and join your fellow dwarves in a fast-paced co-op crafting challenge. Gather resources, create weapons, complete demanding orders and survive the chaos together in online multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4811000/fb4cf5b6c3bc76a6e23f940dc4725139b6146d78/header.jpg?t=1785142491", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam